  "prefLabel": "Fis 1002.05 Avoid and minimize harm",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1002.05 “Avoid and minimize harm” means to avoid harm to the maximum extent practicable and then minimize any harm that cannot be avoided.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
